§ `ss 30-33 -- what the person who failed me can be fined (k085: Sentinel, a company; 14% permanent impairment)`

#ASSERT `Is my injury serious harm` FALSE TRUE

#ASSERT `What is the most the duty holder can be fined` `a body corporate` `caused serious harm` FALSE EQUALS 3500000
#ASSERT `What is the most the duty holder can be fined` `a body corporate` `caused a death` TRUE EQUALS 10000000
#ASSERT `What is the most the duty holder can be fined` `another individual, such as a worker` `caused a death` TRUE EQUALS 340000
#ASSERT `What is the most the duty holder can be fined` `another individual, such as a worker` `no more than a failure to comply` FALSE EQUALS 55000

#ASSERT `What is the longest prison term in years` `an individual who is an officer` `caused a death` TRUE EQUALS 20
#ASSERT `What is the longest prison term in years` `a body corporate` `caused a death` TRUE EQUALS 0

